WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:46.730 --> 01:48.700
It's ringing! It's ringing!

01:48.800 --> 01:52.940
I think it's about time you
learned how to use the phone.

01:52.940 --> 01:55.540
All right, try calling my cell next and...

02:01.950 --> 02:03.880
Can't you use these?

02:08.060 --> 02:10.150
I get it! It's a perfect fit.

02:13.390 --> 02:14.830
This is my number.

02:15.160 --> 02:19.790
It'll be easier to remember it if you
think of it as 090-OSTRICH-MAN.

02:21.570 --> 02:25.340
If you change the numbers like that,
it does spell out OSTRICH-MAN.

02:25.940 --> 02:28.370
So I get to talk to you whenever I want now?

02:28.580 --> 02:31.310
Yeah. But I won't be able to pick up
the phone during class.

02:32.580 --> 02:35.210
All right. All right!

02:36.050 --> 02:40.990
Our Fox Deity, Makes a Call

03:09.980 --> 03:10.610
Yes?

03:10.790 --> 03:13.280
Hi! Cat Delivery here!

03:13.820 --> 03:15.690
What do you want?

03:15.690 --> 03:21.860
Uhh, for delivery. I have a package for you.

03:22.000 --> 03:24.430
All right. Please wait.

03:26.940 --> 03:28.160
Thank you for waiting.

03:28.700 --> 03:32.100
Is this the residence of Takagami Toru?

03:32.410 --> 03:33.110
Yes.

03:33.110 --> 03:36.710
Then can I get your signature stamp?

03:36.710 --> 03:38.340
Right here, please!

03:39.550 --> 03:42.180
Thank you very much!

03:43.820 --> 03:45.480
Bye now!

03:57.170 --> 04:00.160
That's a huge box. Who's it for?

04:00.540 --> 04:01.590
For you.

04:01.670 --> 04:02.800
What? For me?

04:04.110 --> 04:05.440
Who could it be from?

04:19.220 --> 04:20.210
What's the matter?

04:23.120 --> 04:25.590
What was inside it?

04:26.690 --> 04:28.250
A-A person...

04:28.530 --> 04:29.260
What?

04:40.810 --> 04:42.940
What's going on here?

04:50.290 --> 04:51.220
Hey...

04:53.860 --> 04:55.980
I thought she looked at me just now.

04:56.120 --> 04:59.290
Is getting transported like
this popular these days?

04:59.290 --> 05:01.460
Are you being serious here?

05:01.960 --> 05:02.900
I'm kidding.

05:03.200 --> 05:05.390
The cloth wrapping around her is enchanted.

05:05.630 --> 05:07.530
Enchanted? Then that means?!

05:07.900 --> 05:10.630
But I don't believe she is a yokai...

05:10.970 --> 05:11.960
So she's human?

05:12.270 --> 05:14.040
She can't be a human either.

05:14.710 --> 05:18.200
Humans don't get wrapped
up in enchanted cloth.

05:18.650 --> 05:20.810
But you are right about it not being a yokai...

05:20.950 --> 05:25.520
Ko, was the delivery guy who brought
the package a normal person?

05:25.520 --> 05:28.150
Yes, it was a regular cat person.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.450
A cat person...

05:30.530 --> 05:34.660
Hi there! Cat Mark Delivery!

05:34.830 --> 05:35.820
Oh...

05:36.200 --> 05:39.170
I know. Maybe there's
something on the packing slip.

05:40.970 --> 05:44.770
How do I read this? Perishable? Or live animal?

05:45.070 --> 05:46.440
I'm home!

05:49.410 --> 05:52.680
Toru, did you order this from
some shady mail order place?

05:52.680 --> 05:57.620
Of course not. What about you, Dad?
Did you mail order something using my name?

05:57.890 --> 06:00.410
I don't like mail ordering things.

06:00.560 --> 06:03.490
When did you all conclude it's
from some mail order thing?

06:04.030 --> 06:05.550
Please do not fight.

06:05.830 --> 06:06.990
We're not.

06:08.930 --> 06:14.230
She doesn't look very comfortable.
Why don't we get that white cloth off?

06:14.570 --> 06:19.270
Enchanted cloth is used to
seal or suppress something.

06:19.910 --> 06:24.310
I don't know what this thing is, but I
wouldn't remove it so carelessly if I were you.

06:24.710 --> 06:26.480
Okay, I won't.

06:27.250 --> 06:28.270
A wise decision.

06:29.750 --> 06:32.750
But still. What should we do, Shiro-chan?

06:32.750 --> 06:34.520
Shiro-chan? You mean like the color?

06:34.620 --> 06:36.820
Well yeah, she's all white
and pale and everything.

06:36.960 --> 06:40.020
I guess...

06:49.470 --> 06:54.910
We couldn't decide what
to do about Shiro-chan...

06:55.940 --> 06:58.240
I wonder if Shiro-chan woke up yet...

06:58.550 --> 07:00.740
He's going to strike out.

07:08.320 --> 07:10.380
Strike! You're out!

07:10.760 --> 07:14.000
See? He's not keeping his eyes on the ball.

07:14.000 --> 07:16.160
His swing isn't fluid enough, either.

07:17.600 --> 07:20.190
He might not be human.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.830
Don't you think so?

07:23.170 --> 07:27.610
Why not tell that to him directly?
He might appreciate the advice.

07:28.340 --> 07:30.670
I'll let you have the honor.

07:31.050 --> 07:33.740
But I do want you to tell me one thing.

07:34.020 --> 07:34.850
What's that?

07:34.950 --> 07:39.680
Have you seen a young girl with tattoos
all over her body in the last few days?

07:39.790 --> 07:40.850
Tattoos?

07:41.260 --> 07:44.120
She also keeps her eyes shut at all times.

07:46.030 --> 07:47.120
Nope.

07:47.930 --> 07:49.860
Okay, then. Thanks.

07:53.800 --> 07:57.570
Oh, another thing. How is the Kugen fox?

07:57.640 --> 07:59.370
You know each other?

07:59.740 --> 08:00.760
Something like that.

08:01.280 --> 08:02.940
Yeah, Ku-chan is doing fine.

08:03.080 --> 08:04.700
That's good to hear.

08:17.830 --> 08:21.320
Thanks for getting the dry cleaning for me.

08:21.730 --> 08:22.490
Not at all.

08:22.660 --> 08:24.290
Did Shiro-chan wake up yet?

08:25.030 --> 08:27.660
Not yet. She is still asleep.

08:28.140 --> 08:31.070
I wonder if she's okay.

08:33.770 --> 08:36.970
This way. No, that way...

08:37.410 --> 08:40.710
I can smell it...

08:42.580 --> 08:44.180
What does she smell?

08:56.300 --> 08:58.560
They're huge...

09:02.970 --> 09:04.630
It opened!

09:07.070 --> 09:10.340
Excuse me. May I ask you something?

09:11.310 --> 09:12.640
S-Sure.

09:12.780 --> 09:20.090
Have you seen a young girl with tattoos
all over her body in the last few days?

09:20.090 --> 09:22.020
No, I haven't.

09:22.560 --> 09:23.260
No.

09:23.260 --> 09:28.190
That's weird. I guess I'm
feeling kind of off today.

09:28.500 --> 09:30.090
Oh, well.

09:30.300 --> 09:32.320
Thanks a lot.

09:36.070 --> 09:38.130
Was she human?

09:38.540 --> 09:39.470
No.

09:39.610 --> 09:42.870
Looks like I'm starting to get the hang of it.

09:43.540 --> 09:46.510
But what was she, then?

09:46.980 --> 09:48.010
I do not know.

09:51.990 --> 09:52.680
Where's Ku?

09:53.150 --> 09:54.780
Probably out on a walk.

09:57.120 --> 09:57.990
What's wrong?

10:01.700 --> 10:03.560
The Kannagi-ko is shining.

10:04.430 --> 10:05.460
The Kannagi-ko?

10:05.630 --> 10:07.690
An invisible powder.

10:08.200 --> 10:11.260
I scattered it throughout
the house as a precaution.

10:11.910 --> 10:19.240
If anyone aside from you, Toru-sama,
Haruki-sama, tenko-sama, or I touch it...

10:19.450 --> 10:21.850
...it will emit a light only I can see.

10:23.750 --> 10:26.550
And that powder is shining right now?

10:27.520 --> 10:28.320
Yes.

10:32.390 --> 10:34.380
Please stay here.

10:34.960 --> 10:36.400
S-Sure.

10:50.650 --> 10:52.770
Shiro-chan is gone?

11:12.170 --> 11:13.190
Shiro-chan?

11:16.600 --> 11:18.770
Shiro-chan, did you wake up?

11:43.460 --> 11:44.760
Do you want something to eat?

11:45.170 --> 11:46.830
Are you hungry?

11:49.370 --> 11:51.360
Do you understand what I'm saying?

11:53.670 --> 11:56.370
Is the cloth on your face too tight?

11:58.810 --> 12:00.010
It's no use.

12:00.850 --> 12:03.910
But how did she get up to the second floor?

12:04.520 --> 12:07.040
Her hands and feet are all tied up.

12:07.350 --> 12:08.650
I'm home!

12:09.020 --> 12:10.150
Welcome home.

12:10.320 --> 12:10.790
Yeah.

12:11.160 --> 12:12.820
Hey! Shiro-chan! You're awake?!

12:13.430 --> 12:16.090
Yeah, but she's...

12:19.530 --> 12:21.430
She's smiling...

12:30.910 --> 12:33.740
Okay, you're going to be taking care
of Shiro-chan.

12:33.880 --> 12:36.480
Huh? Why me?

12:37.220 --> 12:42.250
She didn't react to me or Ko at all,
but she smiled the moment she saw you.

12:42.490 --> 12:45.650
She likes you. That's why you're caring for her.

12:46.830 --> 12:48.260
Oh, okay then.

12:49.460 --> 12:50.490
I'm going to go change!

12:51.130 --> 12:52.620
Well, that's that, Shiro...

12:56.470 --> 12:58.800
Shiro-chan? What is wrong?!

12:59.470 --> 13:02.640
It's Toru! Toru! Come back here!

13:04.550 --> 13:07.380
I'll make a compromise and go dance the
mambo, or the salsa, or the lambada.

13:07.380 --> 13:09.420
I'll make a compromise and go dance the
mambo, or the salsa, or the lambada.
That's called a TV. Do you know what it is?

13:09.420 --> 13:10.320
No one's going to be dancing the
mambo, salsa, or lambada here!
That's called a TV. Do you know what it is?

13:10.320 --> 13:12.190
No one's going to be dancing the
mambo, salsa, or lambada here!

13:12.190 --> 13:13.650
No one's going to be dancing the
mambo, salsa, or lambada here!
This is the first time you saw it?

13:13.650 --> 13:14.140
No one's going to be dancing the
mambo, salsa, or lambada here!

13:15.060 --> 13:17.050
Isn't that cloth on your face too tight?

13:18.560 --> 13:21.260
Wow... They're actually
carrying on a conversation.

13:33.270 --> 13:37.370
Where is she?! She should have arrived by now.
What's going on?!

13:37.750 --> 13:39.680
Shimenogi is calling them right now.

13:40.480 --> 13:46.350
Boss! The Cat Delivery said the
package from Inamochi Company...

13:46.350 --> 13:50.290
...has been delivered to one
Takagami Toru in Suzunose.

13:50.990 --> 13:51.790
Why?

13:51.790 --> 13:57.830
Both the delivery firm and Inamochi Company
say they delivered to the right address...

13:57.830 --> 13:59.890
They're even saying the mistake was on our end.

14:00.500 --> 14:01.400
That's impossible!

14:01.400 --> 14:05.200
How would I mess up writing
my own name and address?!

14:06.570 --> 14:08.840
Could it be someone is playing a trick on us?

14:09.610 --> 14:13.100
Considering what's in the package,
I can't ignore that possibility.

14:13.380 --> 14:16.950
Find out everything you can
about this Takagami Toru...

14:16.950 --> 14:19.890
Takagami Toru is a descendant
of the water shamans.

14:21.120 --> 14:22.020
The Mizuchi?

14:22.260 --> 14:26.090
I heard their lineage ended since no
girls had been born in the family.

14:26.530 --> 14:30.790
But Takagami Toru's elder brother is supposed
to be the head of the Mizuchi family.

14:31.330 --> 14:36.800
And through his familial connections,
their current guardian deity is the tenko Kugen.

14:36.800 --> 14:38.330
The Kugen fox?!

14:38.910 --> 14:42.240
I thought it was sealed.

14:42.240 --> 14:45.440
The current head freed it, I hear.

14:45.850 --> 14:49.780
So you mean to say the Kugen fox
stole the Byakki from under us?

14:50.150 --> 14:51.850
It would seem so.

14:52.590 --> 14:54.110
But for what?

14:54.220 --> 14:58.160
That fox is a delinquent who was
sealed due to its excessive tricks.

14:58.560 --> 15:04.230
The Byakki was near it. I wouldn't
be surprised no matter what it did.

15:05.200 --> 15:06.930
We must recapture her.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.430
At all costs!

15:20.310 --> 15:22.680
The Culture Festival was fun.

15:22.850 --> 15:25.790
But in the end, I couldn't ask him anything.

15:26.650 --> 15:30.120
Will time keep passing with nothing happening?

15:30.120 --> 15:33.250
At this rate, I'll be an old woman
before I tell him how I feel.

15:34.530 --> 15:36.690
No! You have to snap out of it!

15:37.000 --> 15:39.560
I have to talk to Takagami...

15:39.700 --> 15:43.260
But he's never alone...

15:48.040 --> 15:49.100
Now's my chance!

15:49.780 --> 15:50.680
Takagami.

15:51.650 --> 15:52.300
Yeah.

15:52.850 --> 15:55.180
Do you want to walk home together today?

15:55.180 --> 15:57.080
Uh, sure.

15:58.120 --> 15:59.550
I'll wait for you at the school entrance then!

15:59.820 --> 16:00.810
Sure thing.

16:02.990 --> 16:04.580
You can do this, Misaki!

16:12.000 --> 16:16.200
Dear Takagami-san, please come to the back
of the gym when your club meeting ends.

16:16.770 --> 16:19.400
There is something I want to
talk to you about. From Miyabe.

16:20.370 --> 16:21.340
Miyabe?

16:26.250 --> 16:29.980
Well, I guess it won't take that long...

16:39.090 --> 16:40.620
Hello. I am Miyabe!

16:42.530 --> 16:44.930
S-So what do you want?

16:45.100 --> 16:47.100
I know you are the head of the Mizuchi...

16:47.100 --> 16:47.690
I'm not.

16:49.900 --> 16:51.430
D-Did I get the wrong person?

16:52.470 --> 16:54.070
No, wait. I couldn't have!

16:54.170 --> 16:55.870
You can't play dumb with me.

16:56.080 --> 16:58.410
I already know.

16:58.410 --> 16:59.440
I'm not.

16:59.880 --> 17:00.810
You're kidding, right?

17:01.420 --> 17:03.350
I said I'm not.

17:05.990 --> 17:08.610
I see. Then you leave me no choice.

17:08.960 --> 17:11.480
I will use... rougher methods.

17:14.830 --> 17:16.820
H-Hey!

17:17.700 --> 17:19.960
Let me out of here!

17:21.540 --> 17:24.600
Kidnapper! Help!

17:45.690 --> 17:47.390
Oh, yeah! My cell!

17:49.630 --> 17:51.790
It's gone...
Dammit.

17:52.200 --> 17:53.670
When did they take it?

17:53.970 --> 17:55.990
Who are these people?

17:56.200 --> 17:58.760
It's not for money, is it?

17:59.210 --> 18:04.270
They asked if I was the head of the
Mizuchi family, so they might be yokai.

18:05.150 --> 18:11.140
But I didn't get the feeling
that they weren't human.

18:14.790 --> 18:16.450
I forgot about Sakura...

18:21.200 --> 18:23.490
I just got a text message from Noboru.

18:23.800 --> 18:26.360
He said he's staying over
at a friend's place tonight.

18:26.570 --> 18:29.540
What?! W-W-What about dinner?!

18:29.540 --> 18:32.110
I guess we're not having any tonight.

18:32.110 --> 18:34.670
That is terrible. I will make something.

18:35.040 --> 18:37.370
It's okay. I'll cook.

18:44.150 --> 18:46.140
This is called a comic.

18:57.600 --> 19:00.900
Primordial Heaven-3. Primordial Heaven-2.

19:01.270 --> 19:06.400
Manifested Heaven-1. Manifested Heaven-3.
Primordial Heaven-2.

19:06.670 --> 19:08.980
I have my own job to do.

19:08.980 --> 19:09.910
What job?

19:10.510 --> 19:11.940
Babysitting this one over here.

19:14.650 --> 19:16.220
I take back what I said earlier.

19:16.220 --> 19:17.910
You've changed...

19:30.530 --> 19:32.930
You must be the tenko, Kugen.

19:33.470 --> 19:34.090
Who are you?

19:34.700 --> 19:40.440
We have captured the current
head of the Mizuchi family.

19:41.180 --> 19:42.370
Where's your proof?

19:42.680 --> 19:49.140
The father of the current head should have
received a message on his cell phone earlier.

19:49.420 --> 19:53.350
It was about him staying
at a friend's house tonight.

19:54.150 --> 19:55.120
I see.

19:55.760 --> 19:57.590
So what are you after?

19:57.990 --> 20:02.190
Don't play dumb with me.
There can only be one thing.

20:03.560 --> 20:09.530
We want you to return what you
have stolen from us. That is all.

20:09.740 --> 20:11.970
I never took anything from you.

20:12.610 --> 20:14.870
Are you in any position to feign ignorance?

20:16.940 --> 20:22.880
Come to the San Steroa church sale tomorrow
at noon. Bring what you have stolen from us.

20:23.150 --> 20:24.640
Be sure to come alone.

20:24.920 --> 20:28.850
We will exchange it for your
precious head of the Mizuchi then.

20:30.320 --> 20:31.290
Very well...

20:31.630 --> 20:35.990
I'm sure you already know this,
but do not come empty-handed.

20:36.230 --> 20:39.220
And you better guarantee Noboru's safety.

20:39.630 --> 20:43.540
Of course. We are treating
him quite well right now.

20:44.000 --> 20:47.440
If anything happens to him...

20:47.870 --> 20:49.240
What of it?

20:51.180 --> 20:55.080
I'll make you listen to the sounds
of your appendages melting off.

20:55.320 --> 21:00.150
We'll see how long you can keep that front up.

21:05.030 --> 21:09.020
I feel so stupid. What am I doing?

21:29.420 --> 21:35.840
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:36.360 --> 21:43.560
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:44.900 --> 21:51.390
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:51.570 --> 21:59.210
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

22:00.110 --> 22:07.110
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

22:07.720 --> 22:14.220
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

22:14.460 --> 22:21.870
Daijoubu bokura ha hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:21.870 --> 22:29.510
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:29.510 --> 22:37.150
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:37.150 --> 22:48.390
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:54.800 --> 22:56.560
I don't believe him!

22:56.740 --> 23:00.940
I thought this was going to be
the day I would get to ask him!

23:01.380 --> 23:03.810
How could he go home without me?!

23:05.980 --> 23:08.220
Jerk! Jerk! Jerk! Jerk!

23:08.220 --> 23:10.340
Jerk!

23:13.290 --> 23:17.590
I feel so stupid. What am I doing?

23:25.000 --> 23:25.700
Next Time

23:25.700 --> 23:27.900
Next Time
The snow white girl with red eyes.

23:27.900 --> 23:30.970
Next Time
Where did you come from?
Why do you look like that?

23:30.970 --> 23:31.140
Next Time

23:31.140 --> 23:34.170
Next Time
For some reason, everyone's fighting over you.

23:34.170 --> 23:34.540
Next Time

23:34.540 --> 23:35.080
Next Time
Next Time, "Our Fox Deity, Goes to Church."

23:35.080 --> 23:36.740
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Church
Next Time, "Our Fox Deity, Goes to Church."

23:36.740 --> 23:36.880
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Church

23:36.880 --> 23:39.350
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Church
There are some things we can
tell each other without speaking.

23:39.350 --> 23:39.940
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Church
